usage: query_mapping.py [-h] --graph GRAPH --profile PROFILE --receipt RECEIPT
                        --output OUTPUT [--allow-unmapped-event-labels]
                        [--large-capture]

Join observed same-session query/wait IDs to actual dependency nodes. Elapsed
wall-clock attribution is not CPU work. This deliberately does not claim
execution span or a core-utilization ceiling from an invalidation graph. The
caller must establish paired-file provenance before invoking map_events.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --graph GRAPH
  --profile PROFILE
  --receipt RECEIPT
  --output OUTPUT
  --allow-unmapped-event-labels
  --large-capture       opt in to 4M nodes/32M edges/8M events; file bounds
                        unchanged
